The HATA is necessarily a **convergent interdisciplinarian** — a practitioner whose expertise spans domains that are not traditionally combined in any existing professional training pathway. We characterize the required knowledge architecture as a weighted graph of competencies:

**Tier 1 — Mathematical Foundations:**
