Organizations must designate specific leaders with real authority and board-level visibility who are accountable for developing and executing workforce impact strategies. [MIT Sloan Management Review](https://sloanreview.mit.edu/article/beyond-the-model-why-responsible-ai-must-address-workforce-impact/) The HATA represents the technical specialization of this leadership role — the practitioner responsible not merely for articulating the vision but for the formal engineering of human–AI collaboration architecture.

